# CLAUDE.local.md (PC only, gitignored). Copy to CLAUDE.local.md and fill the <placeholders>.
Loaded on the PC only; phone sessions never see it. Machine paths and PC-only notes go here, never in shared notes. Forward slashes.

## Apps
- Blender exe: <C:/Program Files/Blender Foundation/Blender X.Y/blender.exe>
- Roblox Studio: <C:/Users/USER/AppData/Local/Roblox/Versions/VERSION/RobloxStudioBeta.exe>
- Test browser: <Chrome path or "built-in preview">

## Project folders
- Roblox (Rojo projects): <C:/path/to/roblox>
- Websites: <C:/path/to/web>
- Browser games: <C:/path/to/games>
- 3D assets (.blend, exports; not in git): <C:/path/to/3d>
- Audio (generated wav/ogg; not in git): <C:/path/to/audio>

## PC-only notes
- Blender MCP addon: <how to enable / port>
- Roblox Studio MCP: <where the toggle is>
- Secrets: <env var names only, never values>
